    <string name="faq_q1">Is SONI CARD a real bank?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">No. Version 1.0 is a DEMO interface. It has no connection to any bank.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">Is the money real?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">No. Every balance and transaction is simulated on your device.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">What is the demo SMS code?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">No SMS is sent. The code is shown on screen so you can test the login flow.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">Where is my PIN stored?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Only a salted hash, encrypted with a key in the Android Keystore, stays on your device.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">How do I change the language?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">Open Profile, then Language, and choose Tajik, Russian or English.</string>
    <string name="faq_q6">Will real payments be added?</string>
    <string name="faq_a6">Only after integration with authorized financial APIs and a compliant backend.</string>
